---
description: Testing standards
alwaysApply: true
---

Use:
- pytest
- fixtures

Layers:
- unit tests → domain entities and application use cases only
- integration tests → infrastructure adapters and HTTP endpoints

For every feature:
- Happy path
- Validation errors
- Edge cases

Prefer:
- Independent tests
- Clear test names
- Real in-process fakes over mocks for ports

Avoid:
- Mocking domain objects
- Testing infrastructure logic in unit tests
- Brittle mocks of ports — implement a fake adapter instead